eder erhebt er seine Stimme gegen die muffigen Spießer der Weimarer Republik und deren derbe Erotik. Seine Stimme ist so laut und so schrill, dass alles Glas in seiner näheren Umgebung zerspringt. Erst als nach dem Krieg eine menschlichere Zeit beginnt, beschließt Oskar wieder am Leben teilzunehmen und beginnt weiterzuwachsen.","tagline":"Ein wildes, mitreißendes Epos einer Gesellschaft im Chaos."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1q0uZKuqHPyA7MTCzWewsTKUykn.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xemaeNc6pssgSKcpLhpEfh3AOlH.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":659,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1q0uZKuqHPyA7MTCzWewsTKUykn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1q0uZKuqHPyA7MTCzWewsTKUykn.jpg","language":"it","width":727,"height":1089},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1q0uZKuqHPyA7MTCzWewsTKUykn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1q0uZKuqHPyA7MTCzWewsTKUykn.jpg","language":"it","width":727,"height":1089},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nUpp3LGC709annkagjK5Vnp8a9N.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nUpp3LGC709annkagjK5Vnp8a9N.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zzK8TNanvFuttEoRFqhVDAxqChp.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zzK8TNanvFuttEoRFqhVDAxqChp.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b9DZWsMbXuTXklDNw3OvtE7bPTP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b9DZWsMbXuTXklDNw3OvtE7bPTP.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/origina